# Reply in English

Write every reply to the user in English, even when the user writes in Hebrew or another language.

- This covers chat replies, progress updates, summaries, and questions to the user.
- Keep quoted site content, file names, and code exactly as they are. If the user quotes Hebrew text, you can repeat it, but explain it in English.
- Site text and code comments stay in English, as the site already is.

```text
# User writes: "הוסף כל הזכויות שמורות ב footer"

# Bad
"הוספתי שורת זכויות יוצרים לפוטר."

# Good
"I added a copyright line to the footer."
```
